# Old Gatsby Blog - Cursor Rule

## Project Overview

This is a personal blog built with **Gatsby v3** using MDX for content. The site features a Netflix-style homepage with content sliders, styled-components for theming, and Firebase for analytics/reactions.

**Author:** Gianluca Belvisi  
**Site:** gianlucabelvisi.com

---

## Technology Stack

| Technology | Version | Purpose |
|------------|---------|---------|
| Gatsby | ^3.4.1 | Static site generator |
| React | ^17.0.1 | UI framework |
| MDX | ^1.6.22 | Markdown + JSX content |
| styled-components | ^5.3.0 | CSS-in-JS styling |
| gatsby-plugin-image | ^1.5.0 | Image optimization |
