## Frontmatter Schema

Every MDX post requires this frontmatter:

```yaml
---
path: "/url-slug"              # URL path (required, unique)
date: 2024-01-15               # Publish date (YYYY-MM-DD)
title: "Post Title"            # Main title (required)
subTitle: "Post subtitle"      # Displayed with decorative quotes
author: "Gianluca Belvisi"     # Author name
cardImage: "cover.jpg"         # Thumbnail for sliders (relative path)
featureImage: "cover.jpg"      # Hero image for post page
featureImagePhone: "cover.jpg" # Mobile-optimized hero (can be same)
onHover: "🦄"                  # Emoji shown on card hover
hashtags: "tag1, tag2, tag3"   # Comma-separated, used for filtering
hidden: false                  # Optional: exclude from public listings
---
```

### Special Fields

| Field | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `hidden: true` | Post exists but hidden from sliders/listings |
| `isFuture` | Auto-computed: `true` if date > today (drafts) |
| `hashtags` | Used to filter posts into themed sliders |

