## MDX Components

### Available in All Posts (via MDXProvider)

These components are globally available in any `.mdx` file without imports:

```jsx
// Typography
<Spoiler>Hidden content revealed on click</Spoiler>
<Quote title="Quote" from="Author">Quote text</Quote>
<FigureLabel>Image caption, centered and italic</FigureLabel>
<TextBox title="Box Title">Callout box content</TextBox>

// Media
<YouTube source="dQw4w9WgXcQ" />
<YouTubeAudio />
<ResponsiveEmbed src="https://..." ratio="16:9" />

// Layout
<ThreeColumns>
  <Col1>Left column</Col1>
  <Col23>Right columns (2/3 width)</Col23>
</ThreeColumns>
<Break />
<NewLine />
<Indented>Indented block of text</Indented>

// Special
<Song>Lyrics styled in "Indie Flower" font</Song>
<Question>Question styled in "Irish Grover" font</Question>
```

### Components Requiring Import

```jsx
import {Dialogue} from "../../../components/blog/Text";

<Dialogue>
    Character dialogue with decorative quotes
</Dialogue>
```

