## Content Organization

### Post File Naming

Posts can be named either:
- `post.mdx` (generic)
- `descriptive-name.mdx` (e.g., `sforza1.mdx`)

### Image Handling

- Images live in the same folder as the `.mdx` file
- Reference with relative paths: `![Alt text](image.jpg)`
- Gatsby processes images via `gatsby-remark-images` (max width: 1200px)
- Card/feature images must be specified in frontmatter

### Hashtag System

Hashtags enable content filtering on the homepage:

```javascript
// In index.js
const caterina = posts.filter(post => containsHashtags(post, 'caterina sforza'))
const food = posts.filter(post => containsHashtags(post, 'food', 'coffee', 'diet'))
```

Available hashtags defined in `src/data/Hashtags.json`:
```
jokes, lifestyle, mindfulness, science, health, books, tv shows,
diet, food, tech, travel, investing, history, italy, renaissance,
coffee, the grind, sport, this blog, ...
```

