## Page Creation (gatsby-node.js)

### Dynamic Page Generation

```javascript
// Creates individual post pages
data.allMdx.edges.forEach(({node}) => {
  actions.createPage({
    path: node.frontmatter.path,
    component: require.resolve('./src/templates/blog-post.js'),
    context: { id: node.id }
  })
})

// Creates paginated blog listing pages
// /blog-page1, /blog-page2, etc.
```

### Schema Customization

```javascript
// Auto-computed fields on MDX nodes
isFuture: new Date(frontmatter.date) > new Date()
isHidden: !!frontmatter.hidden
```

