## GraphQL Patterns

### Query for All Posts

```graphql
query {
  allMdx(
    sort: {fields: frontmatter___date, order: DESC}
    filter: {isFuture: {eq: false}, isHidden: {eq: false}}
  ) {
    edges {
      node {
        frontmatter {
          path, title, subTitle, date, hashtags, onHover
          cardImage { childImageSharp { gatsbyImageData } }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### Query for Single Post

```graphql
query BlogPostQuery($id: String!) {
  mdx(id: {eq: $id}) {
    body
    frontmatter {
      path, date, author, subTitle, title
      featureImage { childImageSharp { gatsbyImageData } }
    }
  }
}
```

