## Key Components

### NetflixSlider

Horizontal carousel with:
- Responsive items (2-5 per screen based on width)
- Swipe support (react-swipeable)
- Progress indicators
- Hover zoom effect on cards

### FeaturedPost

Hero section for the latest post with:
- Full-width feature image
- Title overlay
- AOS scroll animations

### Mdx Component

MDX renderer with component mapping:
- Overrides base HTML elements (p, h1-h4, ul, ol, table, a)
- Provides custom components globally
- Handles code syntax highlighting via `prism-react-renderer`

