## Animation Patterns

Uses **AOS (Animate On Scroll)**:

```jsx
<div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="90" data-aos-duration="1000">
  Content animates when scrolled into view
</div>
```

Common animations: `zoom-out-down`, `fade-down`, `fade-right`, `fade-up`, `fade-left`

