## Migration Notes (for Next.js)

When migrating to Next.js, consider:

1. **Replace GraphQL** with file system operations (`fs`, `gray-matter`)
2. **Replace `gatsby-plugin-image`** with `next/image`
3. **Replace `gatsby-plugin-mdx`** with `next-mdx-remote`
4. **Convert styled-components** to CSS Modules (optional)
5. **Recreate page generation** with `getStaticPaths` / `getStaticProps`
6. **Port MDX components** to the new MDX provider setup
7. **Handle image paths** - Next.js needs images in `/public` or special handling

### Key Files to Port

| Old Location | Purpose |
|--------------|---------|
| `src/components/blog/Mdx.js` | MDX provider & component map |
| `src/components/blog/*.js` | Custom MDX components |
| `src/components/styles/Theme.js` | Color/theme variables |
| `src/posts/**/*.mdx` | All blog content |

